Return ONLY a JSON object with this structure:
{
  "name": "short_snake_case_name",
  "role": "Short Role Title (2-4 words)",
  "capabilities": ["cap1", "cap2", "cap3"],
  "triggers": ["keyword1", "keyword2"]
